form.p:
Given by Edd. as f., but appar. m. at Ir. Astr. Tr. 92.27; 

niamh sgáile chladhaigh (: samhail),  Magauran 945. Somet. 

also scáil.

egForm.p:
`searpan' ar geis, Met. Gl. 20 § 63 (séarbán, v.l.). 

searpan .i. geis, O'Cl. `searfan a swan', O'R. `searpán a swan; 

order, custom', ib.

(sen, see Thurn. Gramm. § 259.6) old age: robet ér sinit | 

ar cuirp hi cilicc, Thes. ii 326.5 (Hy. iv) (glossed: .i. set sin; 

.i. iar set sin .i. iar sentaid).

eg.p:
gs.? n.pl.? deich seóid s. ina gaileóin, Ériu xiii 27.29; 

cf. suirrn nó suird .i. aisneis nó soraidh, ut est .x. seoit s. ina 

gabail gaileoin, O'Dav. 1436.
